      "settings": {
        "eyebrow_text": "LINK ONE",
        "heading": "TRAINING BELT",
        "tagline": "Feel when your arms disconnect from your body.",
        "lede": "Wear it for a few slow swings and notice the pull. When the arms race ahead of the turn, you feel it. When they stay connected, the swing stays quieter. No balls, no app — just feedback you can react to.",
